  "details": "A object with the \"VRC Pickup\" script that has \"Synchronize position\" in \"Udon_Behaviour\" or \"Synchronize Physics\" in SDK2 \"VRC_Object Sync\" checked lags behind and jitter locally. A pickup object without these checked behaves as expected. \nPlayers that observe the synced object see no issues.\nExample clip:\nhttps://i.imgur.com/xrCmVUa.mp4",
